      "category": "IMPLICIT_TRANSITION",
      "subject": "transaction",
      "stage": "sip_fsm",
      "description": "Before they forward the request, both proxy servers SHOULD add a Record-Route header field to the request so that all future requests in this dialog will pass through the proxy servers.",
